      "ja": "紙，板紙または紙と同様の方法で加工される材料の機械的加工または変形（全体が紙または板紙で構成されない積層体の製造Ｂ３２Ｂ）",
      "en": "MECHANICAL WORKING OR DEFORMATION OF PAPER, CARDBOARD OR MATERIAL WORKED IN A MANNER ANALOGOUS TO PAPER(making layered products not composed wholly of paper or cardboard <b>B32B</b>)",
      "count": 420,
