      "en": "MACHINES OR ACCESSORIES FOR MAKING, SETTING, OR DISTRIBUTING TYPE; TYPE; PHOTOGRAPHIC OR PHOTOELECTRONIC COMPOSING DEVICES(photographic devices in general <b>G03</b>);<br><br><b><u>Subclass indexes</u></b><br><br><table><tr><td width=\"70%\">HAND COMPOSING </td><td><b><b>1/00</b></b></td></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">MECHANICAL COMPOSING<tr><td width=\"70%\">Using prefabricated type; making type </td><td><b><b>3/00</b>; <b>5/00</b></b></td></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">By casting the type </td><td><b><b>7/00</b>, <b>9/00</b>, <b>11/00</b></b></td></tr></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">PHOTOGRAPHIC COMPOSING<tr><td width=\"70%\">Machines composing lines prior to photography </td><td><b><b>15/00</b></b></td></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">Machines without means for composing lines prior to photography </td><td><b><b>17/00</b></b></td></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">Electronic machines </td><td><b><b>19/00</b></b></td></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">Equipment for special work </td><td><b><b>13/00</b></b></td></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">Details of machines; auxiliaries </td><td><b><b>21/00</b>; <b>23/00</b></b></td></tr></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">PREPARATION OF RECORD CARRIERS </td><td><b><b>25/00</b></b></td></tr></tr><tr><td width=\"70%\">CONTROL, INDICATING, SAFETY </td><td><b><b>27/00</b></b></td></tr></tr></table>",
      "count": 191,
