      "en": "Nozzles, spray heads or other outlets, with or without auxiliary devices such as valves, heating means(<b>B05B3/00</b>, <b>B05B5/00</b>, <b>B05B7/00</b> take precedence; devices for applying liquids or other fluent materials to surfaces by contact <b>B05C</b>; nozzles for ink-jet printing mechanisms <b>B41J2/135</b>; nozzles for liquid-dispensing, e.g. in vehicle service stations, <b>B67D7/42</b>)",
