      "en": "Sharpening cutting edges, e.g. of tools; Accessories therefor, e.g. for holding the tools(non-abrasive sharpening devices for scythes, sickles, or the like <b>A01D3/00</b>; sharpening devices designed as components of machines with cutters, <u>see</u> the relevant places for the machines, e.g. <b>A01D75/08</b>, <b>B26D7/12</b>)",
