    "B60C11/04": {
      "code": "B60C11/04",
      "level": 2,
      "parent": "B60C11/03",
      "ja": "模様の一段高い部分が連続した円周方向のリブのみからなるもの，例．ジグザグ状（Ｂ６０Ｃ１１／１２，Ｂ６０Ｃ１１／１３が優先）［４，６］",
      "en": "in which the raised area of the pattern consists only of continuous circumferential ribs, e.g. zig-zag(<b>B60C11/12</b>, <b>B60C11/13</b> take precedence)",
      "count": 7168,
      "sourceFile": "ipc_B60C.txt",
      "kind": "ipc"
    },
    "B60C11/11": {
      "code": "B60C11/11",
      "level": 2,
      "parent": "B60C11/03",
      "ja": "模様の一段高い部分が隔離要素のみからなるもの，例．ブロック（Ｂ６０Ｃ１１／１２，Ｂ６０Ｃ１１／１３が優先）［４］",
      "en": "in which the raised area of the pattern consists only of isolated elements, e.g. blocks(<b>B60C11/12</b>, <b>B60C11/13</b> take precedence)",
      "count": 5582,
      "sourceFile": "ipc_B60C.txt",
      "kind": "ipc"
    },
