      "code": "B60C11/117",
      "level": 2,
      "parent": "B60C11/03",
      "ja": "隔離凹部からのみ形成されるもの，例．溝，細長い穴または孔（Ｂ６０Ｃ１１／１２，Ｂ６０Ｃ１１／１３が優先）［６］",
      "en": "formed only by isolated recesses, e.g. grooves, slots or holes(<b>B60C11/12</b>, <b>B60C11/13</b> take precedence)",
