      "en": "Brake regulation specially adapted to control the stability of the vehicle, e.g. taking into account yaw rate or transverse acceleration in a curve(road vehicle drive control systems for control of driving stability otherwise than by controlling a particular sub-unit <b>B60W30/02</b>)",
