      "en": "Water sports boards; Accessories therefor; <br><br><b><u>Note(s)</u></b><br><br><ul><li>This group <u>covers</u>:<ul><li>floating structures having a substantially thin body with respect to the width, usually meant to carry one user, which are specially adapted for water sports or leisure, e.g. surfboards, windsurfing boards, wakeboards, stand-up paddle [SUP] boards or water skis;</li><li>accessories for such structures.</li></ul></li></ul>",
