      "code": "B65B11/52",
      "level": 2,
      "parent": "B65B11/50",
      "ja": "一方のシートは，例．加熱により，軟化され，流体圧，例．真空，によって，他のシートおよび内容物と密着されるもの，例．スキン包装",
      "en": "one sheet being rendered plastic, e.g. by heating, and forced by fluid pressure, e.g. vacuum, into engagement with the other sheet and contents, e.g. skin-packaging",
