      "level": 2,
      "parent": "B65D5/20",
      "ja": "側壁と他の側壁の延長部との間に舌片と溝または同様の係合手段をもつもの",
      "en": "with tongue-and-slot or like connections between sides and extensions of other sides",
      "count": 3285,
